<section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-hartwood-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
        <p class="text-hartwood-brown text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4">Our Story</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-hartwood-espresso mb-8 leading-tight">
          Three Decades of<br />
          <span class="italic font-medium">Artisanal Excellence</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-hartwood-walnut leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Founded in 1987 by master craftsman Thomas Hartley, Hartwood Custom Cabinets has been 
            transforming homes across the region with bespoke cabinetry that blends timeless 
            artistry with modern functionality.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every piece that leaves our workshop carries the mark of meticulous attention to detail — 
            from hand-selected hardwoods to precision joinery that stands the test of time. We believe 
            that true craftsmanship is invisible: the drawers glide silently, the doors align perfectly, 
            and the finish feels like silk under your fingertips.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our team of skilled artisans combines traditional woodworking techniques with contemporary 
            design sensibilities, creating pieces that are as beautiful as they are functional. Whether 
            it's a complete kitchen renovation or a single custom vanity, we approach every project 
            with the same dedication to excellence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-6">
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-hartwood-espresso">37+</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-hartwood-walnut mt-1">Years Experience</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px h-12 bg-hartwood-sand"></div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-hartwood-espresso">850+</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-hartwood-walnut mt-1">Projects Completed</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px h-12 bg-hartwood-sand"></div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-hartwood-espresso">100%</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-hartwood-walnut mt-1">Custom Built</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
          <img 
            src="/experiments/hartwood/images/portfolio-2.jpg" 
            alt="Master craftsman at work" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-hartwood-espresso text-hartwood-cream p-6 rounded-xl shadow-xl hidden lg:block">
          <p class="font-display text-lg italic">"Wood speaks to those who listen."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-hartwood-gold mt-2">— Thomas Hartley, Founder</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
